name: Question
description: One question the team answers itself. For a question to the client, use Client question.
labels: ["question", "owner:{{ team_owner_label }}"]
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Search open and closed issues first. Write the title as one sentence a busy colleague could act on, with the
        error or whatever makes this case unusual. Before submitting, read the issue as someone without your context.
  - type: textarea
    id: question
    attributes:
      label: Question
      description: One question. Split it if it needs two answers.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: options
    attributes:
      label: Options
      description: Each option with what it costs or risks.
  - type: textarea
    id: recommendation
    attributes:
      label: Recommendation
  - type: input
    id: answers
    attributes:
      label: Who answers
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: related
    attributes:
      label: Related issues
      description: Issues or PRs you found that look similar, and why they don't cover this one.
  - type: textarea
    id: done
    attributes:
      label: Done when
      value: The answer is recorded under a Clarifications heading in this issue, with its date and who decided.
    validations:
      required: true
